{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4020, "text": "All right, now call the next case."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5780, "text": "How about some breaking and entering,\nsir?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 12440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8400, "text": "But you must understand, the Earth is a\nliving organism. We're becoming like"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12440, "text": "parasites, sucking its life's blood."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 15960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14760, "text": "All right, that's enough."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 20400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16440, "text": "Although stunning imagery, Mr...\nDeYoung, sir."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 25560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20660, "text": "He was a researcher at Sunrise Chemical\nuntil he decided, amazingly enough, he"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 26560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25560, "text": "was unstable."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 28780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27700, "text": "They fired him."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 31030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29050, "text": "Police found him tonight trying to\nburglarize the lab."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 35450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31470, "text": "Your Honor, my client claims he was\nmerely trying to, quote, blow the"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 37110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35450, "text": "the whole mad operation, unquote."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 42910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38050, "text": "They had me experimenting with new\nviruses, bacterial weapons that could"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 44210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42910, "text": "amok and threaten the world."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 47090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45090, "text": "You earth -loving wimps."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 50990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48710, "text": "Save the trees, save the whales."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 55610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51630, "text": "Any fool could save a tree. It took\nAmerican business to invent the"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 56610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55610, "text": "cup."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 59780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57900, "text": "I couldn't have said it better myself."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 61480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60140, "text": "And you are?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 66640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61720, "text": "Mike Foley, director of public relations\nat Sunrise Chemical, where we took the"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 67860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66640, "text": "thick out of toxic."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 75200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69160, "text": "Be alarmed at Mr. DeYoung's hysterical\nviews. Our work is to help mankind. It's"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 77200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75200, "text": "benign. It's harmless."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 78580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77560, "text": "It's here."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 80620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79000, "text": "Run for your lives."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 85720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84400, "text": "Mr. DeYoung."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 88570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87050, "text": "What exactly do you have there?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 92230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89050, "text": "This is a vial of experimental bacteria."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 94690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92550, "text": "I wanted to show the world what this\nwill do."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 96550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95550, "text": "What will it do?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 99090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98090, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 104250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99930, "text": "And that's the point. No one knows what\nhorrible plague we've concocted here."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 109370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107830, "text": "That's one way to find out."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 157360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153900, "text": "The floor's been evacuated except for\nthose in the court when the test tube"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 158360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157360, "text": "broke."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 159720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158680, "text": "Is that door sealed?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 164380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160240, "text": "Good. We don't want any more people\nexposed. No telling what effect this"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 165380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164380, "text": "has had."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 170540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 169540, "text": "My God,"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 173780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172560, "text": "they've already mutated!"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 179420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 175420, "text": "Oh, no, don't worry. He always looks\nthat way."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 186360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183400, "text": "You mind telling me what the hell is\ngoing on here? It's just a precaution."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 190140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186640, "text": "Right now, we don't know what the\nbacteria's effects are."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 193300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190920, "text": "But we're sure that it'll prove\nharmless."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 195280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193520, "text": "We'll have you out of there lickety\n-split."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 198780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196420, "text": "Call me immediately if one of them drops\ndead."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 202680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201440, "text": "What, so all we can do is wait?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 206060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202960, "text": "Oh, it's okay. I'm sure we'll only be\nstuck here a few hours."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 209860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206500, "text": "Right, right. I'll just have to pay my\nbabysitter a few hours overtime. No big"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 210860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 209860, "text": "deal."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 213100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212100, "text": "We're all gonna die!"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 215880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214080, "text": "Shut up, you little lab lizard."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 219060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217400, "text": "It's your fault we're all in this."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 221780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219880, "text": "Come on now, it's nobody's fault."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 225180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222220, "text": "Some things just happen because they're\nmeant to be."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 227800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225720, "text": "With all due respect, Harry, that's a\nlot of crap."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 234080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229380, "text": "Oh, I agree with him, Dan. My father\nused to say fate plays a bigger hand"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 234879, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234080, "text": "we know."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 235698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234880, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 238560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235700, "text": "One way or another, fate brought us all\nhere tonight."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 241500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239080, "text": "What brought us all here tonight is our\nlousy jobs."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 248100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242840, "text": "I can't speak for you, Dan, but I think\nfate played a hand in me getting my job."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 252580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249660, "text": "Fate and a guy named Melman."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 278780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275240, "text": "Nice duds. Who are you with? The nitty\n-gritty dirt van?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 281400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280400, "text": "What's your shtick?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 286180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282040, "text": "Huh? Read my lips. What do you do?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 287720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286560, "text": "Oh, I'm a magician."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 289940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288060, "text": "Oh, you and a million other losers."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 291380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290380, "text": "You any good?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 294120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291800, "text": "Well, I like to think so. You tell me."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 302340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301340, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 306320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304960, "text": "Don't give up your day job."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 310540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307280, "text": "You know about it. Besides, that isn't\nmy only trick. I'll show you another."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 312160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310680, "text": "Don't bother. I can tell already."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 314100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312380, "text": "You don't got what it takes."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 316080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315080, "text": "How do you know?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 317260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316260, "text": "I've been around."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 319440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318440, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 322640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320400, "text": "I've been turned down by every agent in\ntown."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 326600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323180, "text": "I've come close a whole bunch of times,\nbut something always seems to go wrong."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 330120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327080, "text": "Hey, does somebody have to hit you over\nthe head?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 332760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330460, "text": "It's fate telling you to give it up."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 334970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333150, "text": "And take a job pumping gas."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 336590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335350, "text": "I don't need to do that."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 341230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336990, "text": "I got a degree, and I was awarded a\nmerit scholarship to law school."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 345390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341510, "text": "Well, then it's fate telling you to go\nto law school."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 350630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347310, "text": "The thing is that I'd always wonder if I\nmissed my chance."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 353830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351890, "text": "No, I'm going to give it one more shot."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 356650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354970, "text": "I'm a magician, damn it."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 360590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358870, "text": "What? What do you mean, dream?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 363340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360840, "text": "in your magic crap in here, these kids\ntoday."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 367220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363920, "text": "They're into discotheque, mood rings,\nthe fruit."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 369020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367640, "text": "Now, come on, get out of here, will you?"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 370660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369440, "text": "Don't come back, either."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 376040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373600, "text": "So, what do you do?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 380980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379980, "text": "Never mind."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 384320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381100, "text": "Yeah, yeah, forget him, Marty. Look, I\ngot a new partner and everything."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 386460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384640, "text": "Hey, Marty. Shut up, Shane."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 390960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389640, "text": "Hey. Kid, come here."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 392179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391280, "text": "Come back here."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 393180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392180, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 396420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394260, "text": "Look, you came in to do your act."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 397719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396820, "text": "Let's see it."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 401820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397720, "text": "All right, so you can tell me it stinks\nand humiliate me and destroy my ego,"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 405680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401860, "text": "drive it into the ground. I'm not going\nto let you do that to me. I give up on"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 407300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405680, "text": "show business. You want magic?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 408540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407540, "text": "Mm -hmm."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 410640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409180, "text": "I'll show you some magic."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 421360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420360, "text": "be a trick, kid."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 423400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422400, "text": "It is."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 425500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424400, "text": "One of my best."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 427940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426940, "text": "You like it?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 429420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428420, "text": "Like it?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 430440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429440, "text": "I love it."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 432800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430860, "text": "I like you, kid. You got moxie."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 437380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433660, "text": "Really? I showed that trick to every\nagent in town. They all hated it."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 441660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437620, "text": "Well, that's the great thing about show\nbusiness, you know. Only takes one guy"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 442439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441660, "text": "to love it."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 443600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442440, "text": "And I love it."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 445600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444240, "text": "I can't believe this."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 448240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446040, "text": "I was this close to giving up."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 451630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448580, "text": "So many bad... Things have been\nhappening to me lately. I was thinking"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 453710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451630, "text": "giving up magic and going to law school."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 455970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453930, "text": "Forget about law school. You're going to\nbe a star."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 459710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457090, "text": "First you'll be headlining in clubs.\nNext stop, Vegas."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 462690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460130, "text": "And then we open on Broadway."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 466830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463670, "text": "Broadway. The Winter Garden. And then\nit's on to Hollywood."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 469030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467150, "text": "We'll make millions, kid, I tell you."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 470850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469230, "text": "Millions. What do you think, kid?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 473690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471210, "text": "What do I think? I think this is the\ngreatest thing that I've ever..."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 478860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474640, "text": "Stick with me, kid. I'm the only guy in\ntown that can make your dreams come"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 480520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478860, "text": "true. I'm gonna..."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 494560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480520, "text": "He's"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 499820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494560, "text": "dead."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 503360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501040, "text": "Couldn't have happened to a nicer guy."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 513330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509770, "text": "as soon as they carted Melman away, I\nmade a beeline for the law school"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 514330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513330, "text": "admissions office."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 515890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514510, "text": "Whatever happened to little Sid?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 519650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516450, "text": "Last I heard, he was understudied to\nPinocchio in summer stock."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 522950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521950, "text": "Okay, everybody."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 524070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523070, "text": "Good news."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 525550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524230, "text": "What? What?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 529970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525870, "text": "We get to go home? Not yet. In fact,\nyou'll have to stay here overnight."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 534750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530390, "text": "But Sunrise Chemical is springing for\npizza!"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 550640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549640, "text": "This might not be so bad."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 552720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550720, "text": "We can just pretend it's a slumber\nparty."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 554200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553200, "text": "Slumber party."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 560400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554480, "text": "Great. That means... You"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 566040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560400, "text": "do that again, I'll have you shot and\nstuffed."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 572180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568040, "text": "Kids, kids, kids, let's try to get\nalong, okay? What do you say we tuck in"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 573180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572180, "text": "call it a night?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 574380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573380, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 577200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574640, "text": "If this thing causes convulsions."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 580010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577930, "text": "It'll be a lot less painful if we're\nsleeping."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 583390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580990, "text": "If I were you, I'd sleep with one eye\nopen."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 592650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590110, "text": "Dan, I can't give you any more room."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 594150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593150, "text": "No problem."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 600850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597630, "text": "Dan, I toss and turn a lot. I can't\npromise I won't hit you."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 603430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602430, "text": "No problem."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 607150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606030, "text": "Lights out, campers."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 613620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612620, "text": "Good night."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 621780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620140, "text": "Don't let the bed bugs bite."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 629900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628800, "text": "Sweet dreams."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 633400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631820, "text": "I'm sorry, but I can't sleep."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 637520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634880, "text": "Sometimes when I couldn't sleep, my mom\nwould tell me a story."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 639820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638820, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 645220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640680, "text": "Once upon a time, there was a man who\nkept his friends awake until they beat"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 646940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645220, "text": "into unconsciousness with all his heart."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 651560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649500, "text": "I like my mom's story better."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 655120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653320, "text": "Okay, Bull, I have a story, too."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 658540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655840, "text": "Like Harry's, it was about a crucial\nturning point in my life."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 663540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659260, "text": "I was 19 years old, and I was a\ncontestant in the Miss Greater Buffalo"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 664540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663540, "text": "pageant."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 669100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668100, "text": "Thank you, darling."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 674410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669870, "text": "Our next contestant is Miss Lackawanna,\nDebbie Lane."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 676110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674930, "text": "She's 19."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 680690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676390, "text": "The measurements are 38, 23, 36."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 689050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686310, "text": "38? Sure, if you count the Kleenex."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 692050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690570, "text": "Christine, you're next."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 695290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692270, "text": "Remember, smile and stop pulling that."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 700080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697260, "text": "Oh, look, Lisa, I'd like to win. I could\nuse the scholarship, but I prefer to"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 701080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700080, "text": "earn it with my brains."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 705040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701320, "text": "Christine, the Lord gave you brains for\nyour whole life. He only lends you those"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 707680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705040, "text": "while you're young. You can use\neverything you've got."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 710200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708900, "text": "I don't know. It's not me."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 713080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711940, "text": "Oh, I mean, yeah, that's me."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 717240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714020, "text": "I mean, I don't think this is me. I\nmean, look at her."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 719980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718440, "text": "Miss Lackawanna, here's your question."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 723780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721000, "text": "How would you feed the hungry of the\nworld?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 729980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724880, "text": "I would feed the hungry of the world a\nbalanced diet of the four major food"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 730980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729980, "text": "groups."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 732960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731700, "text": "Miss Lackawanna!"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 739100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736480, "text": "I can't believe that stupid answer!"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 742700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740120, "text": "I don't think it was stupid. They liked\nit."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 747200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743220, "text": "Oh, sure. Well, they like mindless\ndrivel. Like, I don't think women should"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 749480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747200, "text": "worry about politics because it takes\ntheir minds off their children."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 751960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750960, "text": "That's perfect."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 754260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753020, "text": "I can't say that."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 759080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756200, "text": "You know, ever since I was a little\ngirl, this was my dream."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 763480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759720, "text": "But I realize that the world has more to\noffer, and I have more to offer than"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 764480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763480, "text": "just a pretty face."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 766840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765840, "text": "You know something?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 768540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767180, "text": "I can't be part of this."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 773000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769060, "text": "You know, it pretends to celebrate\nwomen. Really, it degrades them. I hear"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 774240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773000, "text": "you're in the lead. I am?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 776820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775820, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 780280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777180, "text": "Well, pageants are a part of American\ntradition."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 782600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781180, "text": "I guess I should be proud to be part of\nit."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 783980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782980, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 786820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784580, "text": "Christine, we're all in this together."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 790520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787140, "text": "And if I can't win, I want you to win."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 798400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791880, "text": "Our next contestant is Miss North"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 801600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798400, "text": "Tonawanda Christine Sullivan."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 805660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802740, "text": "You're on. Say what they want. Be with\nme."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 815500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810120, "text": "15 of 19. The measurements are 37, 23,\n35."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 820600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816840, "text": "Christine is a junior considering a\ncareer in law."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 824220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821240, "text": "Wow. I wonder what her future husband\nwill think of that."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 828260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825920, "text": "So, Christine, here's your question."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 832160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829200, "text": "What do you feel is a woman's place in\nthe community?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 839220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834180, "text": "Well, I think that a woman of the 70s\nshould take an active role in..."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 841970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840970, "text": "In her family."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 848270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842930, "text": "I think that, as in politics, women\nshouldn't worry about politics because"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 851530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848270, "text": "shouldn't... Wait, that's not what I\nwanted to say."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 855370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851770, "text": "Oh, Miss North Tonawanda, you were doing\nso well."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 861370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857650, "text": "Well, what I meant to say is that I\ndon't think that women should hesitate"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 864770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861370, "text": "take an active role because, well, we\nhave every right to."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 867370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865590, "text": "Women should nurture their families,\nyes."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 871590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868010, "text": "But beyond feeding their children, we\ncan help feed the world if only we can"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 875650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871590, "text": "make society realize that we're more\nthan just pretty faces. We can make a"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 876650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875650, "text": "difference."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 883770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879730, "text": "Well, Christine, food for thought."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 886330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885330, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 895710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890650, "text": "Our next contestant is Miss Mayapak Lisa\nBrown."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 902780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901520, "text": "Let me fix it up for my principal."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 909440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905300, "text": "So, Lisa, what do you feel is a woman's\nplace in the community?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 914520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910380, "text": "I think women shouldn't worry about\npolitics because it takes their minds"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 915520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914520, "text": "their children."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 917720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916720, "text": "Wonderful answer!"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 923240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921140, "text": "Hey, wait a minute. That was my\nwonderful answer."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 924740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923480, "text": "She stole my answer."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 927940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925640, "text": "You can't give her the title. I'm the\none that deserves to win."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 929660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928500, "text": "At least I told the truth."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 932870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930270, "text": "We don't need the truth, kid. We need\nsomebody that can win."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 937130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933350, "text": "Oh, I get it. We can't have Christine.\nShe's too smart. What we need is a"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 942090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938550, "text": "This contest is a sham. It's degrading\nto women. It's insulting."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 944150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942590, "text": "And Miss Lackawanna stops her bra."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 950750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948470, "text": "I lost because I took a stand."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 954850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951430, "text": "It was then I realized that I would\ndevote my life to righting injustices."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 957210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955670, "text": "That's why I became a public defender."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 993270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992270, "text": "You keep your hands to yourself."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 995450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993850, "text": "Oh, I know it was a nightmare."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 997250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995950, "text": "I dreamt you were in danger."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1002170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997910, "text": "Really? You were... You were trapped in\na deep valley."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1005910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002890, "text": "I was flying to your rescue on a giant\ncigar."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1013450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010730, "text": "By the way, guys, thanks a lot for\nfalling asleep during my story."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1016470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014230, "text": "Well, we're awake now. You want to tell\nit again?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1019930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018930, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1021780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020400, "text": "Someone else should tell their story."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1023520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022300, "text": "Hey, Roz, how about you?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1024800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023800, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1026099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025099, "text": "Actually,"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1028280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026480, "text": "I have an interesting story."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1033560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029780, "text": "It's about a shy little boy and a Bunsen\nburner."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1035480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034480, "text": "Shut up."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1044280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040579, "text": "I bet Roz is one of those lucky types\nwho knew what she wanted right from the"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1045280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044280, "text": "start, right?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1049810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045560, "text": "Well... All I knew was I liked wearing a\nuniform and working with people."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1054610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053130, "text": "Hi, I'm Rod."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1060130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057210, "text": "And I'm pleased to be your hostess on\ntoday's flight."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1066170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062890, "text": "Please follow along carefully as I run\nthrough the safety drill."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1070930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068070, "text": "Always keep your seatbelts fastened when\nthe light is on."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1073590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072170, "text": "That includes you, sir."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1084820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078240, "text": "Now, if the plane should make a water\nlanding, inflate your life jackets by"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1086060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084820, "text": "pulling these tabs."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1090340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087480, "text": "If you do as I say, you will stay\nafloat."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1095160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092480, "text": "The rest of you will drown like mangy\nrats."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1101080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098840, "text": "In case of sudden depressurization,"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1103350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102190, "text": "Don't come crying to me."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1106290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104070, "text": "I'll be too busy saving my own butt."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1112770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109190, "text": "While I'm doing that, these will drop\ndown in front of you."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1116710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113070, "text": "Take the cord and wrap it around your\nneck. Russell?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1118590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117590, "text": "Think."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1122070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118850, "text": "The first thing you learned in flight\nattendant school, what was it?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1124570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123570, "text": "We're here to serve."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1125770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124770, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1129090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126250, "text": "Russell, I'm not sure you're a Paramus\nAir person."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1132390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129930, "text": "Yes, I am, really. I can do this job."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1133710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132710, "text": "We'll see."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1137550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133750, "text": "You may have completed training, but you\ndon't complete probation until this"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1138550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137550, "text": "flight is over."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1139910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138910, "text": "I'll be watching."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1144269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143310, "text": "Forty minutes."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1146290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144270, "text": "That's all I've got to do, and I'm home\nfree."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1149950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147290, "text": "Where's my kosher meal? Where is it?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1152710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150210, "text": "Hey, please, one at a time."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1155610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153450, "text": "Hey, lady, they got headphones."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1156870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155870, "text": "I want headphones."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1158470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157470, "text": "Certainly, sir."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1163770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161990, "text": "Stewardess, my baby needs milk."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1165250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164250, "text": "I'll get you some."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1167450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166370, "text": "Did you want a beverage?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1171850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168430, "text": "Let me guess, first time flying?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1174990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173790, "text": "Hey, baby!"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1177910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176510, "text": "I want a beverage, too."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1179610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178350, "text": "Didn't I just get you one?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1181050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179850, "text": "No, no, you didn't."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1182930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181930, "text": "My mistake."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1184030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183030, "text": "I'll get you one now."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1189410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1188410, "text": "Calm down."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1191660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189520, "text": "Just a little turbulent. I'm too young\nto die."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1193360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191960, "text": "Then you'd better let go."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1197640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194500, "text": "Stuart, my baby just threw up. So?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1201420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200240, "text": "I'll get on it right away."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1230830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227850, "text": "I know. More milk, more food. No, take\nthis diaper."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1238270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234390, "text": "Russell, we land in five minutes."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1241170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240030, "text": "I'm gonna make it."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1242910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241710, "text": "I'm gonna make it."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1244710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243230, "text": "Nothing can stop me now."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1249770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248770, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1254270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251770, "text": "Why didn't I get one of those?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1256750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254890, "text": "You want one of these? Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1258810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257050, "text": "You really want one of these? Yeah."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1260210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259210, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1264270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261410, "text": "How about the rest of these?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1266310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264630, "text": "Those headphones working out okay?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1273030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267890, "text": "I said don't get up when the seatbelt\nlight is on."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1274970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273550, "text": "Didn't you want a hot towel?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1279570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277690, "text": "Russell, you're fired."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1283330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280730, "text": "Fired? You mean I failed my probation?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1285030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283690, "text": "Mm -hmm. There's no way I..."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1294050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287150, "text": "In that case... You can take this job,\npeople screaming in my face, giving"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1295290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294050, "text": "me one hassle after another."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1297670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1296370, "text": "Except this guy."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1300830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298290, "text": "He's the only one who didn't give me a\nproblem."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1303370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301810, "text": "Take this plane to Havana."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1324480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321100, "text": "Russell, that's not the way the manual\nsays to handle a hijacking."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1327860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326620, "text": "But I'll overlook it."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1332200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328500, "text": "In fact, I'm willing to overlook all\nyour past mistakes and hire you"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1333200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332200, "text": "permanently."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1336560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333320, "text": "Forget it. I'd rather spend my life\ndealing with guys like him."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1344940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342520, "text": "So, I finally found what I was good at."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1346620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345620, "text": "Kicking butt."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1349720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348420, "text": "And you're glad you're here?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1351380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350380, "text": "No regrets?"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1355940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352260, "text": "Oh, no. Why would I want to be anywhere\nelse when I can be stuck here wondering"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1357220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355940, "text": "if I'll live through the night?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1360900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358960, "text": "Roz, you've got to look on the bright\nside."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1364180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361260, "text": "I mean, in situations like this, bad\nnews always travels fast."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1366440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364480, "text": "So far, we haven't heard anything."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1368500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367500, "text": "Bad news!"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1375300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374120, "text": "See it out with the viruses?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1376820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375820, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1379820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377160, "text": "We put a rat in with the culture that we\nmade."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1382140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380320, "text": "And it died almost instantly."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1389720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388160, "text": "Why all the long faces?"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1391720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1390380, "text": "You'll get another rat."}
